  m_text: "Carlie, you\u2019re alone in a 90s arcade. Your parents left you here
    while they went to the movies, but something feels wrong. The lights flicker,
    the air is heavy, and someone is stalking you.\r\nYour goal is simple: play the
    machines, earn tickets, and get snacks to keep your energy up. Most importantly\u2014don\u2019t
    fall asleep.\r\nGood luck.  "
