  m_text: 'Welcome to Stay Awake: The Arcade Stalker


    Objective

    Stay awake
    until time runs out. Play mini-games to earn tickets, which can be exchanged
    for food to restore your energy. If you run out of coins, you can purchase more
    at the shop. Good Luck.


    Controls

    H - Help

    P - Pause

    E -
